---
import TraitCard from '@components/ui/TraitCard.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 px-8 md:px-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl">
    <!-- Heading -->
    <div class="animate-on-scroll mb-10">
      <p class="text-brand text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">About</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-gray-900">Who Am I?</h2>
      <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-brand mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio -->
    <div class="animate-on-scroll space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        Hi I'm <strong class="text-gray-800">Antonio</strong>, currently Sales Engineer at{' '}
        <em>Brightcove.</em> Previously I worked for five years in Customer Success, starting as a
        Technical Support Engineer Tier II, making my way up to Technical Support Manager.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before becoming a Technical Support Engineer, I spent some time in the development field as
        a back-end developer specializing in process automation, problem resolution, and server
        maintenance for build optimization.
      </p>
      <p>
        Having a solid technical background gave me a significant advantage when I started my
        Technical Success role, where I quickly took on a kind of Technical Lead position, handling
        urgent high-profile escalations for critical customers.
      </p>
      <p>
        I would be happy to bring my technical experience and Customer Success skills to help your
        customers succeed with your product.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Trait cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <TraitCard title="Analytical Thinking" accentClass="border-brand" icon="bulb" />
      <TraitCard title="Customer Focus" accentClass="border-brand-red" icon="globe" />
      <TraitCard title="Software Dev Experience" accentClass="border-brand-yellow" icon="code" />
      <TraitCard title="Leadership" accentClass="border-brand-purple" icon="heart" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
